Column 08: Pr - Median receiver power (dB)
Column 09: FaA - Atmospheric noise (dB)
Column 10: FaM - Man-made noise (dB)
Column 11: FaG - Galactic noise (dB)
Column 12: DuA - Upper decile deviation of atmospheric noise (dB)
