Column 14: DuM - Upper decile deviation of man-made noise (dB)
Column 15: DlM - Lower decile deviation of man-made noise (dB)
Column 16: DuG - Upper decile deviation of atmospheric noise (dB)
Column 17: DlG - Lower decile deviation of atmospheric noise (dB)
Column 18: DuT - Upper decile deviation of total noise (dB)
Column 19: DlT - Lower decile deviation of total noise (dB)
Column 20: FamT - Total noise (dB)

